 "_featureComment": "Live equivalent: globalSetting.appProp.orderManagementFeatures. EVERY action-bar button and mobile-footer action on /orders is gated behind one of these, and allocationStatus additionally gates a whole table column. All are enabled here so the full surface is visible; flip any to false to see the live app's reduced layout. NOTE: the live page also carries a Google Sheet export/sync toolbar; it is deliberately excluded from this prototype (divergence D9). createDelivery is the odd one out: its comment says 'defaults to shown' but the code checks `=== true`, so it is actually hidden unless explicitly enabled -- reproduced as-is, see divergence D10.",
 "_insightComment": "Fields feeding the Smart Insights hover card (generateOrderInsights in OrderTable.jsx). Live these are computed from the dispatch/delivery/return records themselves; the seed carries the derived figures directly since those record sets are a later phase."
